Package: data2thesis
Type: Package
Title: Data for 'From Data to Thesis: Research Data Analysis with R'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Polla", "Fattah", email = "polla.fattah@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Graduate Wellbeing Study, the simulated case study used
    throughout the book 'From Data to Thesis: Research Data Analysis with R'. It follows 600
    graduate students over four semesters: background information, a
    22-item questionnaire on stress, burnout, supervisor support and
    satisfaction, semester records of GPA, sleep, study habits and
    wellbeing, a randomly offered wellbeing workshop, open-ended answers,
    and weekly visits to a university counselling service. The data is
    simulated for teaching and describes no real people. Raw versions of
    the data (a messy Excel export and an SPSS file) are included for the
    chapters on importing and cleaning data.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://polla-fattah.github.io/R4NTR, https://github.com/polla-fattah/R4NTR
BugReports: https://github.com/polla-fattah/R4NTR/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
